PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY:
DevOps Engineer with a background in military aviation and an automation-first mindset. Skilled in Kubernetes, Terraform, AWS, Linux, and CI/CD pipelines. Built production-grade, cloud-native platforms with GitOps workflows, secrets management, persistent storage, and full observability stacks. Track record of automating infrastructure, eliminating bottlenecks, reducing root cause analysis time by ~20%, and achieving deployments in under 8 minutes.

